    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18967" root="سحف" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَجَفٌ</span></b>  <i>Slenderness of the waist:</i> and <i>lankness
of the belly.</i> (K.) One says <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى خَصْرِهِ سَجَفٌ</span> <i>In
his waist is slenderness:</i> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى بَطْنِهِ سَجَفٌ</span> <i>In
his belly is lankness.</i> (TA.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَجِفَتْ</span>,
in the first paragraph.]

